  "scientific_limits": {
    "en": "{\"representation\":\"living-reconstruction\",\"scope\":\"Whole heavy hippo-like long torso, shortened limbs, high-set eyes and large canine teeth.\",\"scientific_limits\":{\"en\":\"Whole living reconstruction, not a scan or a single complete measured individual. Skull reference UNISTRA.2015.0.1106 measures 555 mm premaxilla to occipital; MGS1493 greatest skull length 600 mm belongs to a different specimen. AMNH1496 and Osborn mounted skeleton are additional comparisons. Body, ear, lip, tail and skin dimensions are artistic estimates, not fossil soft-tissue measurements. Semiaquatic behavior is a hypothesis; no tapir trunk or rhinoceros horn is justified.\",\"zh\":\"完整活体复原，非扫描或同一实测完整个体。UNISTRA.2015.0.1106 前颌至枕部555毫米为实测，MGS1493最大颅长600毫米属另一标本；AMNH1496及Osborn骨架为额外对照。全体、耳、唇、尾与皮肤尺寸为复原估值，非化石软组织实测。半水生为推断，不添加貘鼻或犀角。\"},\"original_inventory_ordinal\":628,\"taxon\":\"Metamynodon planifrons\",\"classification\":\"Amynodontidae, Rhinocerotoidea, Perissodactyla\",\"scale\":{\"unit\":\"meter\",\"bony_skull_length_m\":0.555,\"nose_rump_model_m\":3.0,\"shoulder_height_model_m\":1.35,\"tail_model_m\":0.55,\"status\":\"555mm premaxilla-occipital measured in 2023 Table3 UNISTRA.2015.0.1106. Fullbody artist estimate from skeletal outline, not same-specimen measurement; avoid presenting 3m as measured.\"},\"diagnostic_targets\":[\"Heavy elongate broad torso with deep ribs and short stout limbs; not slender Hyracodon or high-legged running rhino.\",\"Broad cheek and short facial region with eyes high on the skull; restrained rounded ears and thickened upper lip inferred, no long tapir trunk.\",\"Clearly visible paired enlarged canine tips near mouth front, upper canines downwards, restrained lower canines upwards; no saber-cat fangs or elephant tusks.\",\"Absolutely no nasal/frontal horn. Low smooth head profile with a modest fleshed posterior crest, not a tall horn.\",\"Four functional hoofed toes on EACH forefoot, three on EACH hindfoot; do not inherit Hyracodon three-front-toe count.\",\"Substantial neck, broad rump, tapering tail, restrained gray-brown skin with no armor plating.\"]}",
    "zh": "原创低多边形研究；形态、尺度及不确定性严格以本次已核参考为界。原始限定：{\"representation\":\"living-reconstruction\",\"scope\":\"Whole heavy hippo-like long torso, shortened limbs, high-set eyes and large canine teeth.\",\"scientific_limits\":{\"en\":\"Whole living reconstruction, not a scan or a single complete measured individual. Skull reference UNISTRA.2015.0.1106 measures 555 mm premaxilla to occipital; MGS1493 greatest skull length 600 mm belongs to a different specimen. AMNH1496 and Osborn mounted skeleton are additional comparisons. Body, ear, lip, tail and skin dimensions are artistic estimates, not fossil soft-tissue measurements. Semiaquatic behavior is a hypothesis; no tapir trunk or rhinoceros horn is justified.\",\"zh\":\"完整活体复原，非扫描或同一实测完整个体。UNISTRA.2015.0.1106 前颌至枕部555毫米为实测，MGS1493最大颅长600毫米属另一标本；AMNH1496及Osborn骨架为额外对照。全体、耳、唇、尾与皮肤尺寸为复原估值，非化石软组织实测。半水生为推断，不添加貘鼻或犀角。\"},\"original_inventory_ordinal\":628,\"taxon\":\"Metamynodon planifrons\",\"classification\":\"Amynodontidae, Rhinocerotoidea, Perissodactyla\",\"scale\":{\"unit\":\"meter\",\"bony_skull_length_m\":0.555,\"nose_rump_model_m\":3.0,\"shoulder_height_model_m\":1.35,\"tail_model_m\":0.55,\"status\":\"555mm premaxilla-occipital measured in 2023 Table3 UNISTRA.2015.0.1106. Fullbody artist estimate from skeletal outline, not same-specimen measurement; avoid presenting 3m as measured.\"},\"diagnostic_targets\":[\"Heavy elongate broad torso with deep ribs and short stout limbs; not slender Hyracodon or high-legged running rhino.\",\"Broad cheek and short facial region with eyes high on the skull; restrained rounded ears and thickened upper lip inferred, no long tapir trunk.\",\"Clearly visible paired enlarged canine tips near mouth front, upper canines downwards, restrained lower canines upwards; no saber-cat fangs or elephant tusks.\",\"Absolutely no nasal/frontal horn. Low smooth head profile with a modest fleshed posterior crest, not a tall horn.\",\"Four functional hoofed toes on EACH forefoot, three on EACH hindfoot; do not inherit Hyracodon three-front-toe count.\",\"Substantial neck, broad rump, tapering tail, restrained gray-brown skin with no armor plating.\"]}"
  },
